  "summary": "I’m a software engineer and technical lead bringing two decades of experience to AI-driven software development. My work combines application and database expertise with custom AI-agent tooling, grounded in the judgment to design, test, and deliver dependable software.\n\nI’ve built a custom development harness that connects AI agents with requirements, tickets, tools, and verification. It structures how work moves forward and requires evidence before work is considered complete. I apply my engineering experience throughout: defining the problem, evaluating the design, investigating failures, and checking the result.\n\nAt Experity, I worked across Windows and ASP.NET applications, AWS/S3, TypeScript, SnowFlake, SQL Server query optimization, index tuning, data integration, and healthcare reporting. That experience gave me a practical understanding of complex business software and the billing, coding, and financial workflows it supports.I’m interested in senior engineering, technical leadership, and AI developer tooling roles where I can combine deep technical experience with new ways of building software.",
